[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10146.469, "timestamp": "02:49:06", "text": "頁面。  所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10149.429, "timestamp": "02:49:09", "text": "，我決定保留「關於」頁面，也就是現在這個頁面。我會把這些都刪除，因為我要把所有這些資訊都放在資料裡。我會把它做成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10151.99, "timestamp": "02:49:11", "text": "類似其他網站的簡短介紹。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10154.181, "timestamp": "02:49:14", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oh damn"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10158.425, "timestamp": "02:49:18", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so its a portfolio"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10163.19, "timestamp": "02:49:23", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10166.07, "timestamp": "02:49:26", "text": "，我下次會這樣做。給你看一秒鐘。  稍等片刻。你已經見識過人生百態了。現在他們有了人才展示頁面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10170.15, "timestamp": "02:49:30", "text": "不，就像凡人預覽版那樣。是的。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10180.389, "timestamp": "02:49:40", "text": "。我會這樣安排，我們的成員也會如此。  主啊，請您垂憐。  對，就像這樣。我會保留之前製作的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10199.349, "timestamp": "02:49:59", "text": "關於頁面。  是的，我會做一個像這樣的簡短視覺總結和一個圖庫之類的東西。  我考慮過把「關於」部分做成這樣，然後在資訊頁面上提供完整的"}]